flowchart LR
 Client --> Corr[Correlation ID]
 Corr --> AuthN[Authentication]
 AuthN --> Tenant[Tenant Resolution]
 Tenant --> Ent[Entitlement]
 Ent --> AuthZ[Authorization Policy]
 AuthZ --> Validate[Request Validation]
 Validate --> Idem[Idempotency]
 Idem --> Domain[Domain/Workflow]
 Domain --> Data[Tenant-aware Data Access]
 Domain --> Outbox[Domain Event Outbox]
 Domain --> Audit[Audit Evidence]
 Data --> Obs[Logs/Metrics/Traces]
 Outbox --> Obs
 Audit --> Obs
